				\begin{document}$${\text{V}}$$\end{document}</tex-math><inline-graphic xlink:href="41598_2025_23402_Article_IEq23.gif"/></alternatives></inline-formula> can be expressed in terms of <inline-formula id="IEq52"><alternatives><tex-math id="d33e1006">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
